# m7_drops (M7 drops, PLAN.md M7 "Formations and drops"): 1942's rule. A crate comes from a
# whole formation shot down (+200 on top of the last kill) or from any beetle killed by a
# bolt; a formation that loses a member (it flies off or rams the ship) drops nothing, and
# kinds outside formations drop nothing (the M6 "every fifth gnat" rule is gone). Input:
# m3_boss's sweep in god mode (debug_god at 31) to 1699, stage 1 (UNIT TESTS).
# Re-pinned for the catch-up clock (waves.zig: the stage clock runs 4 ticks a tick while fewer
# than 3 enemies are on the field, so every wave after the first comes sooner than its table
# second):
# - The two opening gnat strings (y 40 at update 151, y 88 at 268) are formations: eight of
#   their ten gnats are shot down (248..366, score 80) and two get past the ship and are lost,
#   so neither is complete: no crate (drops 0 at 500).
# - 394..460: a wasp vee (no formation) shot down, +90 (score 170): no crate.
# - 631: a beetle shot down (+50): crate 1 (drops 1, pickups 1; at 751 until the catch-up).
# - 807 and 829: a spider and a moth (+40 each): no crate.
# - 896: the last gnat of the 20 s string (a formation, all five shot down 879..896):
#   +10 +200 (score 543 -> 753) and crate 2 (at 1290 until the catch-up).
# - 1071: the second beetle: crate 3 (at 1460 until the catch-up).
# - The faster table brings four more crates by 1700 (two formations, two beetles): drops 7.
# debug_history_check is 0 with the crates in flight.
--frames 1700 --call-at "31 debug_god" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_drops,debug_score --at "366 debug_score == 80" --at "500 debug_drops == 0" --at "500 debug_score == 170" --at "630 debug_drops == 0" --at "631 debug_drops == 1" --at "631 debug_score == 220" --at "631 debug_pickups == 1" --at "640 debug_history_check == 0" --at "806 debug_drops == 1" --at "807 debug_score == 462" --at "829 debug_score == 502" --at "829 debug_drops == 1" --at "895 debug_drops == 1" --at "895 debug_score == 543" --at "896 debug_drops == 2" --at "896 debug_score == 753" --at "905 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1070 debug_drops == 2" --at "1071 debug_drops == 3" --at "1071 debug_score == 933" --at "1080 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_drops == 7"
